">Cashier</span>:      Do you have a points card?<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:      Yes.", "id": 5, "time": "22300", "image": "engenn2le04ob10re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Cashier</span>:      Swipe it through the machine. Your total is $20.10. How do you want to pay? Debit or credit?<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:      Debit.", "id": 6, "time": "30500", "image": "engenn2le04ob10re2img01.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn2le04ob10re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn2le04ob10re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "At the Supermarket", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "In the Checkout Line", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 10, "type": "position"}, {"content": "scholar > Daily Life > Food shopping", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 4, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A1.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Accurately exchange information about buying things in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to pay ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to give money for something you buy ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Can I pay for my groceries?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le04ob10aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you hear at the supermarket. ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "checkout ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the place in a supermarket where you pay for your groceries  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Let's go to the checkout line.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le04ob10aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "cashier ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who works in a store and collects money ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I give the cashier my money.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le04ob10aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "customer ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who buys things  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: This lane is for customers with 10 items or less.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le04ob10aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "coupon ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a small piece of paper that lets you pay less ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I have a coupon for $1.00.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le04ob10aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to swipe", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to pull a card through a machine ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Swipe your card here please.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le04ob10aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "cash ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "money ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I am paying in cash.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le04ob10aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "debit card ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a plastic card you can use to pay for things ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Are you going to pay with your debit card?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le04ob10aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "credit card ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a plastic card you use to buy things and pay for later ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Can I pay with my credit card?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le04ob10aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Demonstrative Adjectives and Pronouns ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Demonstratives are words that show the person or thing you are talking about. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": " The demonstratives are: <span class=\"strong\"> this, that, these</span> and <span class=\"strong\"> those</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Demonstratives tell us about number (singular or plural) and distance (near or far). <br/><span class=\"italic\"> <span class=\"strong\"> Those </span>sweet potatoes look great.  Pass me one please. </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "There are <span class=\"italic\"> demonstrative adjectives</span> and <span class=\"italic\"> demonstrative pronouns</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "A demonstrative adjective tells us about the noun. It comes before the noun.<br /><span class=\"italic\"> <span class=\"strong\"> This</span> potato is good. <span class=\"strong\">That</span> potato is not good. <br/> How much do <span class=\"strong\">these</span> potatoes weigh?  I like <span class=\"strong\"> those</span> sweet potatoes. </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "A demonstrative pronoun replaces a noun. It is on its own. <br /> <span class=\"italic\"> <span class=\"strong\"> This</span>  is good.  <span class=\"strong\">That</span> is bad. <br/>I like <span class=\"strong\"> these</span>. I don't like <span class=\"strong\">those</span>. </span>", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "engenn2le04ob10re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Write a dialogue (6-8 lines) between a cashier and a customer.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use 4 target words.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use the Imperative.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use a demonstrative adjective and a demonstrative pronoun.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Practice reading the dialogue aloud with a partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Switch roles.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I use the correct expressions in a supermarket.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use words related to the checkout line.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I point things out in the checkout line.", "type": "text"}]}]}